":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-17T08:05:48-08:00","id":1355402,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1352992-the-hantu-another-group-of-supernaturals?p=1355151#post1355151\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Well...thats mostly just written in notepads but I can post some links that I stole info from and used for research:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.behance.net/gallery/9816529/INDONESIAN-GHOST\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.behance.net/gallery/9816...DONESIAN-GHOST</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.siamese-heritage.org/jsspdf/1991/JSS_079_2e_ZainTajudin_HantuRayaMalayDemon.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.siamese-heritage.org/jsspdf/1991/JSS_079_2e_ZainTajudin_HantuRayaMalayDemon.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.siamese-heritage.org/jsspdf/1991/JSS_079_2e_ZainTajudin_HantuRayaMalayDemon.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.siamese-heritage.org/jsspdf/1991/JSS_079_2e_ZainTajudin_HantuRayaMalayDemon.pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.sacred-texts.com/sha/sss/sss04.htm\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.sacred-texts.com/sha/sss/sss04.htm</a><br /> <br /> I'll keep hunting.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm just glad people who know about the areas myths are contributing to this thread. Maybe we'll get some Changelings for the area.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-18T00:31:05-08:00","id":1355595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://books.google.com.au/books?id=njDRfG6YVb8C&amp;pg=PA158&amp;dq=hantu&amp;hl=en&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=0ahUKEwjC-_jy4b7mAhXhzDgGHZUpA10Q6AEIPjAD#v=onepage&amp;q=hantu&amp;f=false\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://books.google.com.au/books/content?id=njDRfG6YVb8C&amp;printsec=frontcover&amp;img=1&amp;zoom=1&amp;edge=curl&amp;imgtk=AFLRE71akGIanA4V18g_HTgIY_64nLxiv6PyvkpVjXTliyoQmpDOxJYTOqr-Du5dwbtCrpEVDzVSyWaYY3CjZE4W-LR_3O6e8yiDFKtChJ4iVgwTxydQn9Dr8jiB6Ogl_3HY2ngw-4yq\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://books.google.com.au/books?id=njDRfG6YVb8C&amp;pg=PA158&amp;dq=hantu&amp;hl=en&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=0ahUKEwjC-_jy4b7mAhXhzDgGHZUpA10Q6AEIPjAD#v=onepage&amp;q=hantu&amp;f=false\" target=\"_blank\"> Encyclopedia of Demons in World Religions and Cultures </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://books.google.com.au/books?id=njDRfG6YVb8C&amp;pg=PA158&amp;dq=hantu&amp;hl=en&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=0ahUKEwjC-_jy4b7mAhXhzDgGHZUpA10Q6AEIPjAD#v=onepage&amp;q=hantu&amp;f=false\" target=\"_blank\"> https://books.google.com.au/books?id=njDRfG6YVb8C&amp;pg=PA158&amp;dq=hantu&amp;hl=en&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=0ahUKEwjC-_jy4b7mAhXhzDgGHZUpA10Q6AEIPjAD#v=onepage&amp;q=hantu&amp;f=false </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> This exhaustive volume catalogs nearly three thousand demons in the mythologies and lore of virtually every ancient society and most religions. From Aamon, the demon of life and reproduction with the head of a serpent and the body of a wolf in Christian demonology, to Zu, the half-man, half-bird personification of the southern wind and thunder clouds in Sumero-Akkadian mythology, entries offer descriptions of each demon's origins, appearance and cultural significance. Also included are descriptions of the demonic and diabolical members making up the hierarchy of Hell and the numerous species of demons that, according to various folklores, mythologies, and religions, populate the earth and plague mankind. Very thoroughly indexed. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}